    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Have you ever wanted to pile up your toys to make a track for your radio-controlled cars?\u00a0 <strong>Obstacle Overdrive</strong> offers room after room of tracks to explore that would ordinarily get you in trouble. \u00a0<strong>Parents not included.</strong>\u00a0</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Not a Racing Game</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Master the control of each car and take on crazy tracks filled with obstacles.\u00a0 Take your time and enjoy the challenge of each obstacle.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3412490/extras/96bd5fbaab325c76dc4e182d5e23f7b6.poster.avif?t=1749838925\" width=540 height=304 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3412490/extras/96bd5fbaab325c76dc4e182d5e23f7b6.webm?t=1749838925\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3412490/extras/96bd5fbaab325c76dc4e182d5e23f7b6.mp4?t=1749838925\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Five Unique Cars</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each of the cars you unlock while playing has its own personality and driving style.\u00a0 See if you can beat every level with each car!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3412490/extras/cb2e5709dd14cdec5f912d6f439fa3c9.poster.avif?t=1749838925\" width=540 height=304 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3412490/extras/cb2e5709dd14cdec5f912d6f439fa3c9.webm?t=1749838925\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3412490/extras/cb2e5709dd14cdec5f912d6f439fa3c9.mp4?t=1749838925\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Fun Physics</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tumble down hills, go car bowling, drive over seesaws and log bridges, go through marble pits, and more!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3412490/extras/82f4b7b44f5f7317573907513905d52d.poster.avif?t=1749838925\" width=540 height=304 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3412490/extras/82f4b7b44f5f7317573907513905d52d.webm?t=1749838925\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3412490/extras/82f4b7b44f5f7317573907513905d52d.mp4?t=1749838925\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Collect and Customize</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover fun hats for the cars scattered throughout the game.\u00a0 Use coins to unlock new paint jobs to personalize each car.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3412490/extras/ab4fc5d871fe8213ff9d0c6d0f7230c7.poster.avif?t=1749838925\" width=540 height=304 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3412490/extras/ab4fc5d871fe8213ff9d0c6d0f7230c7.webm?t=1749838925\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3412490/extras/ab4fc5d871fe8213ff9d0c6d0f7230c7.mp4?t=1749838925\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>90s Nostalgia</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Come back in time with us to the 1990s, before tech took over our lives and we had to make our own entertainment.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3412490/extras/fa801342c7a64c1cd9e553ed4d98ab98.poster.avif?t=1749838925\" width=540 height=304 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3412490/extras/fa801342c7a64c1cd9e553ed4d98ab98.webm?t=1749838925\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3412490/extras/fa801342c7a64c1cd9e553ed4d98ab98.mp4?t=1749838925\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Have you ever wanted to pile up your toys to make a track for your radio-controlled cars?\u00a0 <strong>Obstacle Overdrive</strong> offers room after room of tracks to explore that would ordinarily get you in trouble. \u00a0<strong>Parents not included.</strong>\u00a0</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Not a Racing Game</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Master the control of each car and take on crazy tracks filled with obstacles.\u00a0 Take your time and enjoy the challenge of each obstacle.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3412490/extras/96bd5fbaab325c76dc4e182d5e23f7b6.poster.avif?t=1749838925\" width=540 height=304 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3412490/extras/96bd5fbaab325c76dc4e182d5e23f7b6.webm?t=1749838925\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3412490/extras/96bd5fbaab325c76dc4e182d5e23f7b6.mp4?t=1749838925\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Five Unique Cars</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each of the cars you unlock while playing has its own personality and driving style.\u00a0 See if you can beat every level with each car!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3412490/extras/cb2e5709dd14cdec5f912d6f439fa3c9.poster.avif?t=1749838925\" width=540 height=304 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3412490/extras/cb2e5709dd14cdec5f912d6f439fa3c9.webm?t=1749838925\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3412490/extras/cb2e5709dd14cdec5f912d6f439fa3c9.mp4?t=1749838925\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Fun Physics</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tumble down hills, go car bowling, drive over seesaws and log bridges, go through marble pits, and more!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3412490/extras/82f4b7b44f5f7317573907513905d52d.poster.avif?t=1749838925\" width=540 height=304 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3412490/extras/82f4b7b44f5f7317573907513905d52d.webm?t=1749838925\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3412490/extras/82f4b7b44f5f7317573907513905d52d.mp4?t=1749838925\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Collect and Customize</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover fun hats for the cars scattered throughout the game.\u00a0 Use coins to unlock new paint jobs to personalize each car.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3412490/extras/ab4fc5d871fe8213ff9d0c6d0f7230c7.poster.avif?t=1749838925\" width=540 height=304 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3412490/extras/ab4fc5d871fe8213ff9d0c6d0f7230c7.webm?t=1749838925\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3412490/extras/ab4fc5d871fe8213ff9d0c6d0f7230c7.mp4?t=1749838925\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>90s Nostalgia</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Come back in time with us to the 1990s, before tech took over our lives and we had to make our own entertainment.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3412490/extras/fa801342c7a64c1cd9e553ed4d98ab98.poster.avif?t=1749838925\" width=540 height=304 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3412490/extras/fa801342c7a64c1cd9e553ed4d98ab98.webm?t=1749838925\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3412490/extras/fa801342c7a64c1cd9e553ed4d98ab98.mp4?t=1749838925\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
    "short_description": "Cruise through a world of colorful retro inspired toys in Obstacle Overdrive, a cozy off-roading toy car adventure! Navigate fun, challenging courses, tumultuous tumbles, and enjoy the charm of a miniature world where the obstacles are as playful as the ride itself.",
